Professional photo editing tools! Offers features such as background removal, smart keying, and more. There are additional features such as sleep white noise, birth hour calculation, etc.

Subscription:
1, the user can only go through a paid subscription to unlimited use of the keying function, as well as additional sleep white noise, birthdate calculation and other functions;
2, the subscription fee will be deducted from the user's iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase, free trial for three days, can be automatically renewed, the renewal fee of $39.99/year;
3、Users can turn off the auto-renewal subscription 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4、Auto-renewal of subscription Apple ID, will be in each billing cycle 24 hours before the expiration, automatically in the iTunes account deduction and extend the corresponding validity period;
5、Users manage the subscription service, i.e., after purchase, you can go to your user account to set up the automatic subscription to be turned off.

